CC   cloning and sequencing. The 5' end of the mature miRNA was mapped by PCR,
CC   but the 3' end has not been experimentally determined. The predicted
CC   hairpin precursor sequence presented here is supported by conservation in
CC   C. elegans and C. briggsae (MIR:MI0000751), and differs from that shown in
CC   [1] (Uwe Ohler, pers. comm.).  This sequence maps to chromosome II in C.
CC   elegans.
