CC   Two groups independently reported miRs derived from the same precursor.
CC   Lagos-Quintana et al. [1] reported miR-17 expressed from the 3' arm of the
CC   hairpin precursor in HeLa cells.  The presence of the mature miR was
CC   confirmed by Northern blotting, abut the extents of the excised sequence
CC   are unknown.  Mourelatos et al. [2] reported cloning miR-91 from the 5'
CC   arm of the same precursor.  This sequence is renamed miR-17-5p here.
