CC   Human miR-181a, cloned by Dostie et al [2], is predicted to be expressed
CC   from two genomic hairpin loci, hsa-mir-181a-1 (MIR:MI0000289) and
CC   hsa-mir-181a-2 (MIR:MI0000269).  A miRNA from the 3' arm of this hairpin,
CC   named miR-213, was predicted by computational methods using conservation
CC   with mouse and Fugu rubripes sequences, and validated in zebrafish [1].
CC   Subsequent cloning and Northern evidence shows that the 3' mature sequence
CC   is the biogenesis byproduct miR-181a* (Chang-Zheng Chen and David Bartel,
CC   pers. comm.).
XX
