CC   Houbaviy et al. report that the cloned sequence of miR-297 is found over
CC   20 times in the mouse genomic sequence [1].  This sequence appears to
CC   match several low complexity repetitive regions.  Two of the possible
CC   hairpin precursor sequences are represented here, from chromosome 8
CC   (MIR:MI0000395) and 10 (MIR:MI0000397).  Confidence that these are the
CC   loci from which miR-297 is expressed must be low because of the low
CC   complexity nature of the sequence.
XX
