DR   EMBL; AJ560738; MMU560738.
DR   MGI; 2676860; Mirn196a-1.
XX
CC   Reference [1] reports a single genomic position for mir-196 in mouse.  A
CC   search of the NCBIM30 assembly suggests the presence of a second locus.
CC   This sequence maps to mouse chromosome 11.  Yekta et al. report that
CC   miR-196 miRNAs are expressed from HOX gene clusters in mammals, and that
CC   HOX genes in these clusters are targets of miR-196.  Indeed, HOXB8 mRNA
CC   was shown to be a natural target for miR-196-directed cleavage through a
CC   perfectly complementary miR-target site.  Other HOX genes have imperfect
CC   miR-196 complementary sites indicative of regulation by translational
CC   repression [2].
XX
