CC   (MIR:MI0000071) [1,2].  miRNAs derived from the 5' [1] and 3' [2] arms of
CC   the human mir-17 precursor have been reported.  miR-17-5p is perfectly
CC   conserved in mouse, suggesting that it may be the predominant product. The
CC   expression of mmu-miR-17-3p in mouse has been independently verified [3].
CC   This sequence maps to mouse chromosome 14.
