CC   Mouse miR-500 was identified independently by two groups.  Wheeler et al
CC   cloned a mature product with the same length as the human ortholog
CC   (MIR:MI0003184), shown here [1].  Mineno et al report a shorter mature
CC   product with 1 additional base at the 5' end and 3 fewer at the 3' end
CC   (AAUGCACCUGGGCAAGGGUU), referred to as miR-500b in [2].
